{"product_id":"worst-case-a-detective-michael-bennett-novel","title":"Worst Case: A Detective Michael Bennett Novel","description":"\u003cp\u003eChildren of New York's elite are being abducted and held hostage. But the criminal doesn't crave money - he only wants to test these privileged kids to see if they know the price others pay for their luxurious lifestyles. A wrong answer has fatal consequences. To Detective Michael Bennett, it is clear that these murders are only the beginning. Their killer has insanely grand ambitions - and the entire city is about to be brought to its knees. With all of New York in chaos, Bennett teams up with FBI agent Emily Parker and the two set out to capture the mastermind before he sets in motion his ultimate plan - a deadly lesson for the entire world.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: James Patterson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781846054716\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 153 x 234\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761714569369,"sku":"16RD-1-9781846054716","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/worst-case-a-detective-michael-bennett-novel-169682.jpg?v=1694792806","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/worst-case-a-detective-michael-bennett-novel","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}